{"id":"n90412-1-6","stage":2,"title":"대강 · 大纲","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90412-1-6-1","ko":"너는 승규에게 무슨 일이 생겼는지 들었어?","zh":"你听说承奎出什么事了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규에게","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"승규에게","audio":"/audio/798787cc441dabb00906.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생겼는지","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었어?","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6a912e5eb52cc2e91722.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90412-1-6-2","ko":"자세히는 못 듣고 대강만 들었어.","zh":"我没听太清楚，只是大概听说了一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자세히는","meaning":"仔细地，详细地","explanation":"자세히：仔细地，详细地；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"자세히","audio":"/audio/a072ebb77d96a16624a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71196","senseId":"1","lemma":"자세히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"듣고","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대강만","meaning":"大纲，梗概","explanation":"대강：大纲，梗概；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"대강","audio":"/audio/b2806e229535638b33c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90412","senseId":"1","lemma":"대강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었어.","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a072ebb77d96a166","term":"자세히","zh":"仔细地，详细地","audio":"/audio/a072ebb77d96a16624a4.mp3","entryId":"71196","definition":"连很细小的部分都具体而明确地。","pronunciation":["자세히"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"b2806e229535638b","term":"대강","zh":"大纲，梗概","audio":"/audio/b2806e229535638b33c5.mp3","entryId":"90412","definition":"不详细、简单的情节。","pronunciation":["대ː강"]}],"audio":"/audio/0586fc32b629dc7e9daf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.212,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90412","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":74,"sequenceScore":2.0387,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我没听太清楚，只是大概听说了一下。","街上人真不多啊。","你听说承奎出什么事了吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我没听太清楚，只是大概听说了一下。","你听说承奎出什么事了吗？","街上人真不多啊。"],"answer":0}]}
